@host=https://tile-expert-test.local

### Empty body -> 422, every required field is listed
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Broken JSON -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"hash": "broken

### Invalid e-mail and unknown enum values -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456781111",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-9",
    "payment_type": "cash",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "GBP",
    "measure": "km",
    "name": "name",
    "articles": [
        {"article_id": 5, "amount": 1, "price": 1, "weight": 1, "packaging_count": 1, "pallet": 1, "packaging": 1}
    ]
}

### Articles are required -> 422 (articles)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456782222",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-1",
    "payment_type": "visa",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "measure": "m",
    "name": "name"
}

### Empty articles -> 422 (articles)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456783333",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-1",
    "payment_type": "visa",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "measure": "m",
    "name": "name",
    "articles": []
}

### articles is not an array -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456784444",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-1",
    "payment_type": "visa",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "measure": "m",
    "name": "name",
    "articles": "five tiles"
}

### Invalid second article -> 422, errors point to articles[1].*, nothing is saved
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456785555",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-1",
    "payment_type": "visa",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "measure": "m",
    "name": "name",
    "articles": [
        {"article_id": 5, "amount": 12.5, "price": 30.2, "weight": 20, "packaging_count": 1, "pallet": 50, "packaging": 1.44},
        {"article_id": 0, "amount": -1, "currency": "GBP", "multiple_pallet": 9, "delivery_time_min": "soon"}
    ]
}

### Existing hash -> 422 (hash). Send the request from post.orders.http first.
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hash": "12345678901234567890123456780000",
    "token": "1234567890123456789012345678901212345678901234567890123456789000",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "vat_type": "vat-type-1",
    "payment_type": "visa",
    "locale": "en_GB",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "measure": "m",
    "name": "name",
    "articles": [
        {"article_id": 5, "amount": 1, "price": 1, "weight": 1, "packaging_count": 1, "pallet": 1, "packaging": 1}
    ]
}
